 "name": "Supernova",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/blood-manipulation.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Piercing Blood</em></p>\n<p>You can create small orbs of condensed blood that explode like a buckshot. As an action, you condense your <em>Piercing Blood</em> into a tiny orb of blood in an unoccupied space that you can see within 30 feet, which stays there for a maximum of 1 minute before exploding. You can create as many orbs as your proficiency bonus in an action with each having its own cost, spending 5 CE and 5 HP for each, and can choose for them to explode immediately upon creation or manually as a reaction to a creature entering the range of explosion.<br />\n The orb then explodes, forcing every creature within 10 feet of it to make a Dexterity saving throw for each orb. On a failure, the target takes 8d8 piercing damage and is knocked prone. On a success, they take half as much damage and aren't knocked prone.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
